# Intentionally (almost) empty.
#
# The vitest workers pool loads .dev.vars on top of [env.test.vars] from
# wrangler.toml. With decrypted secrets present, that leaks live keys such as
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY into tests and un-skips runIf(Boolean(env.ELEVENLABS_API_KEY))
# cases so they hit mocks instead of staying skipped.
#
# This file shadows .dev.vars for the `test` environment, keeping unit tests
# on the mocked wrangler.toml [env.test.vars] values regardless of whether
# local secrets have been decrypted.
